Use core, io.

A record Account has a monthly rent (a whole number), a remaining balance (a whole number), and a next link (a pointer to Account).
Keep a shared total spent as a whole number.
Let account be Account.
Update account so its monthly rent is 48, its remaining balance is account's remaining balance plus 48, and its next link is no address.
Add account's remaining balance to total spent.
If total spent is not 48.
Stop with error "bad total".
End the condition.
Give back total spent.
